msgid "@kip_sad At the time... I thought it was still her faulty code speaking..."
msgstr "@kip_sad 그때는... 코드 오류 때문에 그런 말을 하는 줄 았았어..."

msgid "@kip_sigh But now I... \\.\\.I'm starting to understand..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh 하지만 이제... \\.\\.이해가 되려고 해..."

msgid "@niko4 ..."
msgstr "@niko4 ..."

msgid "@kip_pout Messiah... \\.\\.I'm sorry..."
msgstr "@kip_pout 구원자... \\.\\.미안해..."

msgid "@kip_sad I'm really, really sorry...."
msgstr "@kip_sad 정말 미안해..."

msgid "@kip_sigh All this time, we've burdened you with our hope, our faith..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh 지금껏 우리의 희망, 우리의 신념으로 너에게 짐을 지운 거야..."

msgid "@kip_pout ...blissfully ignoring the fact that you are just a lost child."
msgstr "@kip_pout ...너는 그냥 길 잃은 아이라는 사실을 모른 척했지."

msgid "@niko3 Well..."
msgstr "@niko3 그게요..."

msgid "@kip_pout You're probably more scared than any of us, aren't you?"
msgstr "@kip_pout 너는 그 누구보다 무서웠을 거야, 그렇지?"

msgid "@kip_pout We... have been dealing with tragedy for so long, it's become background noise to us now."
msgstr "@kip_pout 우리는... 비극을 오랫동안 겪어서, 이런 건 이제 별것도 아니야."

msgid "@kip_sad But for you... \\.\\.it must be so terrifying..."
msgstr "@kip_sad 하지만 네겐... \\.\\.끔찍하게 무섭겠지..."

msgid "@kip_sad And now, you're stuck here with the rest of us..."
msgstr "@kip_sad 그런데 지금 우리와 함께 여기 갇히고 말았어..."

msgid "@kip_pout ...being held back by the very people you were told to save."
msgstr "@kip_pout ...구해야 한다는 사람들 때문에 발이 묶인 채."

msgid "@kip_sigh We must seem so ungrateful..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh 정말 배은망덕하기 짝이 없지..."

msgid "@niko3 ..."
msgstr "@niko3 ..."

msgid "@niko_distressed .....It's...\\> \\@niko_eyeclosed2 .....okay."
msgstr "@niko_distressed .....전...\\>\\@niko_eyeclosed2 .....괜찮아요."

msgid "@kip_pout ..."
msgstr "@kip_pout ..."

msgid "@niko3 I..."
msgstr "@niko3 제가..."

msgid "@niko3 ...when I first came to this world... \\.\\.\\@niko4 a long time ago...."
msgstr "@niko3 ...아주 오래전... \\.\\.\\@niko4 제가 처음 여기 왔을 때..."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 ...back then, all I wanted was to go home."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 ...그땐 그냥 집에 가고 싶을 뿐이었어요."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...\\p... do you remember?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ...\\p 님... 기억나요?"

msgid "@niko2 The very FIRST time..."
msgstr "@niko2 맨 처음..."

msgid "@niko5 I'm not sure how far back it was for you..."
msgstr "@niko5 이 세상에서는 얼마나 오래전인지 모르겠네요..."

msgid "@niko But... I remember towards the end...\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed I... actually wasn't sure anymore."
msgstr "@niko 하지만... 나중에는...\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed 사실 정말 그런지 모르겠더라고요."

msgid "@niko_upset ...about going home."
msgstr "@niko_upset ...정말 집에 가고 싶은지요."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Even knowing the world would be doomed eventually..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 이 세상이 언젠가 파멸한다는 걸 알면서도..."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I... still wanted the people here to be happy..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 저는... 여기 사람들이 행복하기를 바랐어요..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed So...\\.\\. when you told me to return the sun, back then..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 그래서...\\.\\. 태양을 되돌려 놓으라고 했을 때, 그때는..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I didn't even....\\.\\. question it..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 심지어....\\.\\. 이상하게 생각하지도 않았어요..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed So...\\.\\. when you told me to return home, back then..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 그래서...\\.\\. 집으로 돌아가라고 했을 때, 그때는..."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I wasn't... \\.\\.sure..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 저는... \\.\\.확신이.. 없었어요..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed But I trusted you more, \\p..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 하지만 저는 당신을 더 믿었어요, \\p 님..."

msgid "@niko4 ...but then I just... came back."
msgstr "@niko4 ...그런데 저는 왠지... 다시 돌아왔죠."

msgid "@kip_pout You... what..."
msgstr "@kip_pout 너... 무슨..."

msgid "@niko3 And I... went through that decision again, didn't I?"
msgstr "@niko3 그리고 전... 그 결정을 다시 내렸어요. 그렇죠?"

msgid "@niko_upset But...\\.\\. I came back again..."
msgstr "@niko_upset 그런데...\\.\\. 저는 다시 돌아왔어요..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Even though you were able to do both... \\.\\.the effects couldn't be permanent, could it?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 당신은 둘 다 할 수 있었지만... \\.\\.그 효과는 영구적일 수 없었던 거예요. 그렇죠?"

msgid "@niko_upset And then...\\.\\. I found out about the world being like this..."
msgstr "@niko_upset 그때...\\.\\. 전 세상이 이런 처지인 걸 알게 되었어요..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Sigh..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 하아..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Prototype said to forget the things he told me... \\>\\nAnd Cedric told me not to think about it too much, but..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 프로토타입은 제게 자기가 말한 것을 잊으라고 했어요... \\>\\n그리고 세드릭은 너무 깊이 생각하지 말라고 했어요. 하지만..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 저는..."

msgid "@niko4 I'm sorry for getting upset at you... back at the mines..."
msgstr "@niko4 당신에게 화를 내서 미안해요... 광산에서..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...I thought... for you to know all that, yet continue doing this..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ...당신이 이걸 알면서도 계속 이러는 게..."

msgid "@niko_upset2 It... just seemed cruel."
msgstr "@niko_upset2 너무... 잔인하다고 생각했거든요."

msgid "@niko2 But then, I realized something..."
msgstr "@niko2 하지만 그때 전 뭔가 깨달았어요..."

msgid "@niko4 You... really wanted to save both the world and me..."
msgstr "@niko4 당신은 정말로 세상과 나를 다 구하려고 했다는걸요."

msgid "@niko_distressed But at the end, you can only choose one, right?"
msgstr "@niko_distressed 하지만 마지막에는 하나만 선택해야 했어요. 그렇죠?"

msgid "@niko_distressed_talk Is it... really hard for you too?"
msgstr "@niko_distressed_talk 당신에게도... 그게 그렇게 어려운 선택인가요?"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed It must be..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 하긴, 어렵겠죠..."

msgid "@niko3 ...\\.\\.if the world isn't broken...\\.\\. will that choice still be there?"
msgstr "@niko3 ...\\.\\.세상이 망가지지 않았더라도...\\.\\.그런 선택이 필요할까요?"

msgid "@niko4 ...do you...\\.\\. still need to choose between one or the other?"
msgstr "@niko4 ...그래도...\\.\\. 둘 중에 하나를 선택해야 하나요?"

msgid "@niko_sad But... even if it is..."
msgstr "@niko_sad 하지만... 그렇다고 해도..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I... \\.\\.really want to save this world, \\p."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 전... \\.\\.진심으로 이 세상을 구하고 싶어요, \\p 님."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 Even if it's more dangerous this time around..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 설령 이번에는 훨씬 더 위험하다 해도..."

msgid "@niko_distressed_talk Even if... so many of the nice people we met were.... \\>\\@niko_distressed_meow were..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed_talk 설령 이곳에서 만난 좋은 사람들이.... \\>\\@niko_distressed_meow 모두..."

msgid "@niko_sad ......"
msgstr "@niko_sad ......"

msgid "@niko_distressed_talk \\p.... \\>\\n\\@niko_less_sad I'm not.... \\.\\.afraid, anymore...."
msgstr "@niko_distressed_talk \\p 님.... \\>\\n\\@niko_less_sad 전... \\.\\.이제 두렵지 않아요...."

msgid "@niko_cry *sniff*"
msgstr "@niko_cry *훌쩍*"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed That's why...\\>\\n\\@niko3 I think you guys should let me go..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 그게 바로...\\>\\n\\@niko3 저를 보내줘야 하는 이유예요..."

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I... promise I'll be okay..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 괜찮을 거라... 약속할게요..."

msgid "@niko_distressed ...please?"
msgstr "@niko_distressed ...부탁이에요."

msgid "@george1 ..."
msgstr "@george1 ..."

msgid "@george1_hm George has heard your conversation with \\p and is deeply moved!"
msgstr "@george1_hm 조지는 당신과 \\p 님의 대화를 듣고 깊이 감동했어요!"

msgid "@george1_smug That's why... George has full faith in you!"
msgstr "@george1_smug 그래서... 조지는 당신을 전적으로 믿기로 했어요!"

msgid "@george2_grr ...well, I'm convinced."
msgstr "@george2_grr ...흠, 설득력이 있군."

msgid "@george2 After all that...\\.\\. it'd be SUPER rude for me to stop you, wouldn't it?"
msgstr "@george2 이걸 듣고도...\\.\\. 널 막는다면 너무 무례한 짓이겠지?"

msgid "@george3_sigh ...if you must..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh ...꼭 가야겠다면..."

msgid "@george3_sad It... wouldn't be right for me to keep you..."
msgstr "@george3_sad 제가 당신을 막는 건 옳지 않겠군요..."

msgid "@george4_golly Ohhhh..... \\>\\n\\@george4_omg That was BEAUTIFUL!!!"
msgstr "@george4_golly 아아..... \\>\\n\\@george4_omg 정말 감동적이구나!!!"

msgid "@george4_omg Kip!!! Did you hear that! The messiah was trying to encourage \\p!"
msgstr "@george4_omg 킵!!! 방금 들었어요? 구원자가 \\p 님을 격려하려 했어요!"

msgid "@kip_heh I'm right here..."
msgstr "@kip_heh 나도 여기 있거든..."

msgid "@george4_omg I KNOW RIGHT!!! IT HAPPENED RIGHT IN FRONT OF OUR EYES!!!"
msgstr "@george4_omg 그러게 말이에요!!! 바로 우리 눈앞에서 이런 일이 일어났다고요!!!"

msgid "@niko_speak ..."
msgstr "@niko_speak ..."

msgid "@george4_oops ...sorry, got carried away..."
msgstr "@george4_oops ...미안, 너무 흥분해 버렸네..."

msgid "@george4 ...but yes, I think it's only right that we let you go!"
msgstr "@george4 ...그래, 널 보내 주는 게 맞는 것 같아!"

msgid "@george5_sad Aww... sweetie..."
msgstr "@george5_sad 아아... 너는..."

msgid "@george5_sigh You are so brave...\\.\\. even braver than most grown-ups..."
msgstr "@george5_sigh 정말 용감하구나...\\.\\. 어른들보다 훨씬 더 말이야..."

msgid "@george5_hmm It... wouldn't be right for us to keep you, would it?"
msgstr "@george5_hmm 널 잡아 두는 건 올바른 일이 아니겠지?"

msgid "@george5_aww Besides, how can I say no to those puppy-dog eyes!"
msgstr "@george5_aww 게다가, 그런 강아지 같은 눈으로 보는데 어떻게 거절하겠니?"

msgid "@george6_point Yo, kid...."
msgstr "@george6_point 이 녀석..."

msgid "@george6_smile You're real strong, you know that?"
msgstr "@george6_smile 넌 정말 강해, 알고 있어?"

msgid "@niko4 I..."
msgstr "@niko4 저는..."

msgid "@george6_fingerguns Go knock 'em dead, tiger!"
msgstr "@george6_fingerguns 가서 해치워 버려, 호랑이 군!"

msgid "@kip_heh Well, if George is fine with it..."
msgstr "@kip_heh 음, 조지가 괜찮다면..."

msgid "@kip_sigh I... \\.\\.guess we should let you go now, messiah..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh 아무래도... \\.\\.널 보내 줘야 하겠구나, 구원자야..."

msgid "@kip_pout But... promise us you'll be careful, okay?"
msgstr "@kip_pout 하지만... 조심하겠다고 약속해, 알겠지?"

msgid "@niko Mhm!"
msgstr "@niko 네!"

msgid "@niko2 You guys be safe too..."
msgstr "@niko2 여러분도 조심하세요...."

msgid "Oh! You're not injured, are you?"
msgstr "앗! 다치지는 않았지? 다쳤어?"

msgid "The head librarian has converted her room into an infirmary for now..."
msgstr "지금은 수석 사서가 자기 방을 병원으로 바꿨어..."

msgid "If you need a place to rest, let me know."
msgstr "쉴 공간이 필요하면 나한테 이야기해."

msgid "Or... let her know, I guess!"
msgstr "아니면... 사서한테 이야기해도 되고!"

msgid "We're still waiting on another group of evacuees..."
msgstr "피난민들이 또 도착할 거야..."

msgid "One of the apartments on the other side of town got REALLY messed up yesterday..."
msgstr "어제 마을 건너편에 있는 아파트에서 난리가 났거든..."

msgid "Oh, hello!"
msgstr "오, 안녕!"

msgid "The library is currently being used as a shelter right now."
msgstr "도서관은 지금 대피소로 사용되고 있어."

msgid "Lots of those squares are starting to show up on the streets..."
msgstr "사각형이 거리에 무더기로 나타나기 시작했거든..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I know..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 맞아요..."

msgid "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!"
msgstr "아아아아아아!"

msgid "THE WORLD IS ENDING WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO"
msgstr "세상이 끝나 가고 있어. 어쩌면 좋지?"

msgid "@niko Um..."
msgstr "@niko 음..."

msgid "@niko_wtf What... are you doing... to that book?"
msgstr "@niko_wtf 그 책에다... 뭘 하시는... 거예요?"

msgid "Editing it!!!"
msgstr "편집하는 중이지!!!"

msgid "I've been in the Author's shadow for my entire career."
msgstr "난 평생 저자라는 그림자에 가려져 있었지."

msgid "If I'm gonna die soon, I wanna die knowing I put out at least ONE original idea out there!"
msgstr "곧 죽을 신세라면, 나만이 생각해낼 수 있는 아이디어 하나쯤 세상에 내놓고 싶었어!"

msgid "Despite all this...\\.\\. I still really wish I could've met the Author..."
msgstr "말은 이렇게 하지만...\\.\\. 한번이라도 저자를 만날 수 있었으면 좋겠어..."

msgid "@niko It's an ink bottle, complete with a quill."
msgstr "@niko 잉크병과 깃펜이네요."

msgid "@niko_83c Brings back memories, doesn't it, \\p?"
msgstr "@niko_83c 옛날 생각이 나요. 그렇죠, \\p 님?"

msgid "Reading helps me get my mind off things..."
msgstr "책을 읽으면 잡념을 떨칠 수 있지..."

msgid "At least THAT's finally off my bucket list..."
msgstr "이제 죽어도 여한이 없겠어..."

msgid "...y'know, I finally saw the Author today!"
msgstr "...오늘 드디어 저자를 봤거든!"

msgid "Well, his flying machine, at least!"
msgstr "엄밀히는, 저자의 하늘을 나는 기계였지만 말야!"

msgid "I was looking out one of the windows in the library and spotted it in the distance with my binoculars!"
msgstr "쌍안경으로 도서관 창을 내다보고 있었는데, 저 멀리서 하늘을 나는 기계가 보였지!"

msgid "Isn't that cool, messiah?"
msgstr "정말 굉장하지 않아, 구원자님?"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Yeah..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 네..."

msgid "@niko_speak Oh! Um..."
msgstr "@niko_speak 오! 음..."

msgid "@niko2 What book did Cedric take?"
msgstr "@niko2 세드릭이 무슨 책을 가져갔죠?"

msgid "@george1_hm \"The Creation of Prophetbot\", one of the Author's greatest works in my opinion."
msgstr "@george1_hm \"예언봇의 창조.\" 조지가 생각하기에, 저자의 최고 명작이죠."

msgid "@george1 It's filled to the brim with intricate illustrations and blueprints... \\>\\n\\@george1_smile Lots of attention to detail, for sure."
msgstr "@george1 섬세한 삽화와 설계도가 가득해요... \\>\\n\\@george1_smile 구석구석까지 아주 세심하게 쓴 책이에요."

msgid "@george1_hm George rates it 10 out of 10."
msgstr "@george1_hm 조지의 평가는 10점 만점에 10점이죠."

msgid "@niko2 Ooh..."
msgstr "@niko2 오호..."

msgid "@george2_stress One of my favorites, thank you very much..."
msgstr "@george2_stress 내가 좋아하는 책 중 하나야. 참 고맙군..."

msgid "@george2_sigh ...it's the Author's book detailing the creation of Prophetbot."
msgstr "@george2_sigh ...예언봇 창조 과정을 자세히 기록한 저자의 책이지."

msgid "@george2 And by \"detailing\", I mean it! \\>\\n\\@george2_sigh There's a TON of detail in that book."
msgstr "@george2 \"자세히\"라는 표현이 빈말이 아냐! \\>\\n\\@george2_sigh 그 책은 정말 자세히 설명하고 있거든."

msgid "@george2_grr Blueprints, progress shots..."
msgstr "@george2_grr 설계도에, 과정 사진에..."

msgid "@george2_sigh Took me forever to edit..."
msgstr "@george2_sigh 편집하느라 죽도록 고생했지..."

msgid "@george3_sad ...the Author's book on the creation of Prophetbot..."
msgstr "@george3_sad ...예언봇 창조를 다룬 저자의 책이로군요..."

msgid "@george3_sigh ...you know...\\.\\. the first robot you met in our world..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh 아시겠죠...?\\.\\. 당신이 우리 세상에서 처음 만난 로봇 말입니다..."

msgid "@niko2 Yeah."
msgstr "@niko2 네."

msgid "@george3_worry ...oh...\\.\\. The book was quite detailed, too...."
msgstr "@george3_worry ...참...\\.\\.그 책은 굉장히 자세하기도 했습니다..."

msgid "@george3_sigh It...\\.\\. would've been useful to your friend, I think..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh 아마...\\.\\. 당신 친구에게 도움이 됐을 겁니다..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...yeah."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ...맞아요."

msgid "@george4 The Author's book on the creation of Prophetbot!"
msgstr "@george4 예언봇 창조를 다룬 저자의 책이네!"

msgid "@george4_golly Remember Prophetbot? \\.\\.The first robot you met in our world?"
msgstr "@george4_golly 예언봇 기억해? \\.\\.네가 우리 세상에서 처음 만난 로봇 말야."

msgid "@george4_omg He's a work of art!!!"
msgstr "@george4_omg 그 로봇은 그야말로 예술이야!!!"

msgid "@george4_smile The Author's book was so detailed... \\.\\.really made me appreciate how much work went into him!"
msgstr "@george4_smile 이 저자의 책은 굉장히 자세해... \\.\\.로봇을 어찌나 공들여 설계했는지 감탄할 수밖에 없었지!"

msgid "@george5_hmm \"The Creation of Prophetbot\", dear.\\>\\n\\@george5_heh It's one of my favorite books by the Author!"
msgstr "@george5_hmm \"예언봇의 창조\"로구나.\\>\\n\\@george5_heh 저자가 쓴 책 중에서 내가 가장 좋아하는 것이지!"

msgid "@george5_hmm The book contains many detailed blueprints and progress shots."
msgstr "@george5_hmm 책에는 수많은 자세한 설계도와 제작 과정 사진이 수록되어 있단다."

msgid "@george5_smile I really enjoyed editing it!"
msgstr "@george5_smile 편집 작업도 정말 즐거웠지!"

msgid "@george6_point You remember Prophetbot? \\>\\n\\@george6 The first robot you met in our world?"
msgstr "@george6_point 예언봇 기억해? \\>\\n\\@george6 네가 우리 세상에서 처음으로 만난 로봇 말이지."

